Responsibilities include

Has sufficient tools for the job up to &frac12; inch drive.&nbsp;


Ability to perform services and minor repairs to tractor and trailers with&nbsp;guidance and&nbsp;little&nbsp;supervision.&nbsp;&nbsp;


Working knowledge of computers, can follow instructions on how to navigate the work order software, Mechanics Workstation.&nbsp;&nbsp;


Ability to work as an individual&nbsp;while on call&nbsp;performing tire repairs and replacements, minor repairs on equipment such as air leaks, light malfunctions,&nbsp;battery and cable malfunctions and trailer repairs.&nbsp;&nbsp;


