At least 2 years of tractor/trailer&nbsp;or heavy equipment&nbsp;mechanic experience.&nbsp;
Commercial Driver&rsquo;s License (CDL) preferred. (Possession of a Class A CDL&nbsp;is not required and can result in increased pay within the Tier)&nbsp;
Dependable, safety‑conscious, and able to follow instructions.
Strong customer service skills and consistent on‑time performance.

